WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.480
If you can't see something, first check you're on the right child, using the names at the top.

2
00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:14.540
Then check the date. The arrows move between days, and today only fills in once your child arrives.

3
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:22.290
Educators' entries appear within seconds. If something seems missing, pull down to refresh.

4
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:29.300
If it's still missing, or you ever see another family's information, message your director straight away.
